8.3 name: cP!-Hu10.LHA

  Introduction
  ============

    This contents of this archive will update a working installation of
    HydraBBS V1.08 to V1.10.

    This release fixes quite a few minor bugs, and a couple of major
    ones, adds "weektop" and "showpartuploads" doors, and is generally
    much nicer,happier and more stable!

